 "summary": "A wideband RF transformer with a 1:1 impedance ratio for 75 Ω systems, covering 0.4 to 800 MHz, in the six-pad CD542 surface-mount case. The secondary winding has a centre tap. From 1 to 400 MHz, its 1 dB band, amplitude unbalance is 0.1 dB and phase unbalance 1 degree, typically. Typical insertion loss is about 0.4 dB from 5 to 50 MHz and 2.44 dB at 800 MHz. It is aqueous washable and RoHS compliant, marked by the + suffix.",
