  {
   "topic": "Uses",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "Applications: impedance matching and balanced amplifiers."
  },
  {
   "topic": "Board layout",
   "page": 2,
   "text": "Suggested land pattern: six rectangular pads in two rows of three on a 0.100 in (2.54 mm) pitch, to a tolerance of ±.002 in. Demo board: TB-ADT1-1WT+."
  },
  {
   "topic": "Handling",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "The part can be cleaned with aqueous washing. Its construction is covered by US patent 6,133,525."
